<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<FinalDraft DocumentType="Script" Template="No" Version="1"><Content><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="1"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店负二层 · 卸货区 - 日</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一辆海鲜车倒车入库。警示音规律地响。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>一身婚纱的唐茉蹲在矿泉水箱旁，外面罩着黄色外卖冲锋衣。她对一只纸杯背词。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>冰岛海洋研究中心，海洋动物声音组——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏（32）走近。黑色礼服，珍珠耳钉，手里夹着塑封角色卡。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>海洋哺乳动物声学组。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉抬头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你那种说法，像给海豹办歌唱比赛。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉低头，在纸杯上画下第五道横线。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏翻过自己的角色卡。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>特写——唐橙。新娘表姐。常驻冰岛。研究鲸类迁徙。不吃香菜。敬酒九十秒。不要主动谈童年。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>折叠桌旁坐着另外四名“唐家亲友”：高志远（68，退休数学老师）、何莉（29，保险销售）、豆豆（8）和老周（55，殡仪馆司仪）。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>桌牌：0。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>高志远拿红笔在临时族谱上画线。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>高志远</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我是唐茉舅舅。豆豆是我外孙。所以他管唐橙叫——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>两百块。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>高志远</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>叫表姨。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>叫错扣钱吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>婚礼策划人乔姐（40）拍手。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>乔姐</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>最后核验。进厅后分散入席，照片结束退场。顾家不知道唐老师在福利院长大。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉捏瘪纸杯。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>是我让顾言这么说的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>乔姐</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>没人问责任归属。我们只保证现场效果。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她给每个人发胸牌。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>乔姐</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>角色破裂，尾款取消，按合同赔偿。今天你们不是演员——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>众人</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>是唐家亲戚。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>乔姐离开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉从冲锋衣口袋取出一只旧银吊坠，递给季夏。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>致辞时戴着。我小时候照片里有一只一样的。苏阿姨看过。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏翻过吊坠。背面刻着一个浅浅的“茉”。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>这不是道具。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>今天是。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅音乐从楼上传下来。唐茉脱掉黄色外衣，只剩婚纱。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>电梯门打开。她站进去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>表姐，待会儿见。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>门关闭。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="2"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 · 入口 - 稍后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>三百二十名宾客。两块十五米宽的屏幕。手机组成一片举起的黑色树林。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言（30）站在花门下。看见唐茉，他笑；看见她身后空无一人，笑容迟疑半秒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏（56）迎上去，替唐茉整理头纱。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你表姐到了吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉看向侧门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏出现，银吊坠落在胸前。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>苏阿姨。飞机晚点，抱歉。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏握住她的手。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>一家人，说什么抱歉。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉的笑僵了一瞬。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言伸手想碰她，被司仪拉去确认流程。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅大门打开。唐茉独自走上白色花道。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="3"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>快节奏婚礼蒙太奇：</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>—— 高志远在第六桌证明自己会背唐茉“小时候”的数学成绩。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>—— 何莉拥抱唐茉，悄悄往眼里滴眼药水。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>—— 豆豆叫错三个辈分，每次都看乔姐是否扣钱。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>—— 老周与顾家亲戚碰杯，熟练得像主持一场告别仪式。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>—— 顾言几次靠近唐茉，都被敬酒队伍隔开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>司仪</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>下面有请新娘的表姐唐橙，从遥远的冰岛送上祝福。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>掌声。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏走上台。身后大屏亮起蓝色海面和鲸尾。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>冰岛的冬天没有太阳，但并不完全黑——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她看见唐茉。唐茉用口型跟她一起背。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>极夜也会有蓝色的光。唐茉小时候——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>大屏突然闪烁。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>鲸尾消失。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="4"><Text>INT. 酒店负二层 · 第零桌 / 宴会厅（屏幕） - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅大屏切到负二层实时监控。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>第零桌上，五张角色卡摊开。临时族谱正对摄像头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>监控里的高志远拿着季夏的备用卡。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>高志远（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>唐橙研究鲸。何莉和新娘大学同寝。老周认识新娘父亲二十八年——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>可新娘才二十八岁。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>高志远</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>所以从她出生就认识。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>监控收音里传来乔姐的声音。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>乔姐（画外）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>记住，你们不是演员，是唐家亲戚。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅死寂。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>随后，手机快门密集响起。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏站在台上，话筒仍开着。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏抬头看监控，又看季夏胸前的吊坠。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你到底是谁？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>乔姐冲向控制台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>乔姐</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>切信号！现在！</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉放下捧花。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她摘掉头纱，转身走向出口。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言追上去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="5"><Text>INT. 宴会厅侧廊 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉推开消防门。顾言按住门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>茉茉，先听我——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你现在追的是我，还是你跟你妈说过的那个我？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言停了一步。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉看见了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我只是想等婚礼以后慢慢解释。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你设计楼，知道承重墙不能以后再补。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>是我们一起决定的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我决定花钱请人。你决定让我觉得不请人就不配进去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅里，苏敏的声音传来。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏（画外）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>顾言。回来，把事情说清楚。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言回头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>只一秒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉推门离开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="6"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 · 舞台 - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏望着关闭的消防门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>乔姐在台下用手掌划过脖子：闭嘴。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏摘下珍珠耳钉。摘下“唐橙”的胸牌。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我叫季夏。职业演员。今天受雇扮演新娘的表姐。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宾客举起更多手机。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>乔姐拔掉舞台音响电源。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏的话筒没断。它连着婚礼直播手机的备用收音。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>冰岛是假的，鲸是资料片——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她看一眼主桌上被挑出的香菜。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>不吃香菜是真的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>有人忍不住笑了一声。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏把话筒递给顾言。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>剩下的角色，不该再由我们演。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言没有接。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏把话筒放在他脚边，走下台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="7"><Text>INT. 酒店负二层 · 卸货区 - 片刻后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉坐在第零桌旁。婚纱下摆沾着一道黑色机油。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她拧开矿泉水，一口气喝掉半瓶。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏走来，把银吊坠放在桌上。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>尾款我会赔。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>先别抢。现在是我违约。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你为什么说？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你走的时候不像逃婚。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>（停顿）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>像终于从一个角色里下班。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉摸着吊坠上的“茉”字。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我八岁第一次被领养。那家人让我管他们叫爸爸妈妈，拍完家庭照，第二天又把我送回去。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏坐到她对面。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>后来每次照相，我都先问自己该叫什么。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>今天呢？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>今天我花钱，还是没买到自己的名字。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>脚步声。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言走来。他手里拿着直播话筒，手机屏上不断滚动宾客留言。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>直播还开着。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你来关？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我来认。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他按亮话筒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="8"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 / 负二层（直播） - 连续</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>大屏上出现顾言。他站在第零桌旁。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>第一句谎是我说的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅内，苏敏坐在主桌。所有人看屏幕。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言（屏幕）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我妈问唐茉的家人，我说他们在海外。我怕她知道唐茉在福利院长大，会把她当成一份需要评估的风险。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏脸色变了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>负二层。唐茉没有看他。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我也怕直接反抗，会失去家里的支持。所以我把胆小叫保护。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉抬头。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>你把我剪成你家能接受的尺寸。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>对。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他没有靠近她。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我今天不求你原谅。我只把我做的事说完。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他转身走向电梯。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉看着仍在直播的手机。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="9"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 - 稍后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>舞台没有音乐，没有追光。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言独自站在三百二十人面前。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>唐茉没有海外亲属。没有海洋学家表姐。她十八岁以前住过三个福利机构，两次寄养家庭。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>窃窃私语。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>她从来没把这些当成秘密。是我觉得我的家人承受不了真话。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他看向母亲。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>妈，对不起。我用保护唐茉的名义，小看了她，也小看了你。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏没有回应。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宴会厅门打开。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉走进来。没有头纱，没有捧花，也没有挽任何人的手。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她来到台前，拿过话筒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>三个条件。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>众人安静。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>不删直播。不把演员写成诈骗者。今天还结不结，由我听完所有人的真实姓名以后决定。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她看向侧门。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏与第零桌四人站在那里。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="10"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 · 舞台 - 片刻后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>高志远站在话筒前，仍穿着“舅舅”的中山装。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>高志远</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>高志远，退休数学老师。第一次演舅舅，紧张得背了一夜族谱。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>何莉上前，擦掉眼角妆。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>何莉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>何莉，保险销售。刚才那滴眼泪是眼药水刺激的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>（看唐茉）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>希望你幸福是真的。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>老周</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>周平安，殡仪馆司仪。扮演新娘父亲的朋友。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>他取下胸花。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>老周</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>活人的场子，比送别难主持。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>豆豆踮脚够话筒。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>沈一鸣，小名豆豆。我收了两百，花十二块买了冰淇淋，不能全退。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>全场终于笑起来。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏最后上台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>季夏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>季夏，演员。没有代表作。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>今天有了。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>掌声从第零桌的人开始，慢慢扩散。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏走上台。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她没有拥抱唐茉。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>她拿起原本写着“新娘家属”的桌牌，翻到背面。用记号笔写下：我们自己。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>苏敏把桌牌放到第零桌中央。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我现在很生气。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>我也是。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>苏敏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>婚礼还能继续？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉看向顾言。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>重新问。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="11"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 - 黄昏</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>夕阳照进宴会厅。原定流程表被折成垫桌脚的纸片。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>司仪站在新人中间。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>司仪</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>顾言，无论富有贫穷、健康疾病——</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>换一句。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>司仪愣住。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>无论体面，还是难堪。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言看着她。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>无论体面，还是难堪。你愿意和我结婚吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>愿意。但下一次难堪，不能让我最后知道。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>同意。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>现在轮到我问。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>（停顿）</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>顾言，你愿意以后少替别人决定他们承受得了什么吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>顾言</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>愿意。做不到的时候，你可以当众纠正。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>宾客笑。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>那我愿意。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>两人交换戒指。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Scene Heading" Number="12"><Text>INT. 云庭酒店宴会厅 · 合影区 - 稍后</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>摄影师举起相机。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>摄影师</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>新娘家站左边，新郎家站右边！</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>众人下意识移动。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>别分边。站得下就站。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>三百二十个人同时往前挤。合影区瞬间失控。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>最终，镜头里只塞下新人、苏敏和第零桌五人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>季夏站在最外侧。没有胸牌，没有吊坠。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>豆豆举手。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>那我现在还算远房外甥吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>唐茉想了想。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>唐茉</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>算临时证人。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Character"><Text>豆豆</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Dialogue"><Text>证人有红包吗？</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>快门落下。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>照片里，每个人都笑得不够整齐。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>这是当天第一张没有人排练过的照片。</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Transition"><Text>淡出。</Text></Paragraph></Content><TitlePage><Content><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>婚礼第零桌</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>原创小说改编短片剧本</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge 社区样片</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>StoryForge Showcase · 2026</Text></Paragraph><Paragraph Type="Action"><Text>网站展示终稿</Text></Paragraph></Content></TitlePage></FinalDraft>
